  "body": "Closes #751\nClaim: cloud/i751-sonnet\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5\n\nQ-10 answered by the operator (2026-11-10): the moderator alert keeps legacy's mail fallback in release builds.\n\n**Change**\n- `App/Config/Shared.xcconfig`: `MODERATOR_ALERT_MAIL_ADDRESS` set to the address legacy hard-codes (`MessagesView.swift:4580` @ `87fe0d1c`), with a comment citing it. Subject/body format untouched.\n- `Secrets.xcconfig.example`, `App/README.md`, LOT-135 spec (Q-10 answered), ADR 0007 (one sentence: a public contact address is not an API key).\n\n**Tests**\n- `theBuildSettingDecidesWhetherAMessageWithoutAnAlertLinkOffersTheMail`: setting present → mail offered; empty or key absent → not.\n\n**Maintainer note**: an old copy of `Secrets.xcconfig.example` has an uncommented empty `MODERATOR_ALERT_MAIL_ADDRESS =` line that overrides the shared value and turns the fallback off, including in release builds: delete that line in your local `Secrets.xcconfig`.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGSucGJYFpdfpggkv7\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
