   "body": "CI red on fb9eba8, causes:\n\n- **Docs consistency**: my PR body had a `### Ledger` section saying \"no entry\" without the `ledger` label (AGENTS.md §8: no entry means no section, no label). I removed the section from the body. The check reads the body on a push only: a re-run of the failed job replays the old body and still fails (job 130064803760), so it will turn green only on the next push. No code change is needed for it.\n- **App build + tests**: the only failed test is `MessageTitleToneTests/prominentBackgroundUsesThePrimaryStyle(dark:)` (#704, flaky; no other failure in the log). No code change. I re-ran the failed jobs once (run attempt 2, App job queued).\n\nI added no commit (an empty one is not allowed, and a content change just to trigger CI would be made up). The next push, a review round or a docs-only touch decided by the orchestrator, re-reads the body.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
